  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:046044eca48bbb0c30f16c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时何地都要好好打起精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c18be14690e7fe24927ba2609b9ddef75fca15009011357fb608a13e0a579db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65b939b9dbe8fe2fcf4f2f15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当时的我要是知道你成了\r\n签约训练员……一定会非常惊讶吧。\r\n毕竟我现在都还是觉得难以置信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3952cabde2cb897c9e144eeeec937e7a3b0ede629a3d47d445a9c0fdc955663",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34edec03be1af4ed8d49b1bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服是学园学生的证明，\r\n所以服装仪容一定要端正。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb35ee899f827a1adf3e968f3df5c35baabfe7f12294e8d8b347c8dff9ac753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b2e79dde1183ce2547a3600",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装也是表演的一部分，\r\n所以一定要穿着整齐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9526a7d4322af715ffaf1bf2e42fc6940c79c0558cde9cc1589c6c23e036e4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f652b8a45108a93dd91cf55b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美丽并充满机动性……非常好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f492f8bbe4b07a83f4dc5a9498ae131ba4a2262825c709be40506f24eafd39a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c525fe9f04244e51d6586e8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……难道有什么奇怪的地方吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e20afb75821bdcd0c805459199eddc6deadaa90c1aec6bb6388ee36a5f8c03e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:985113f1b6d4f9a04bb972d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live我也没有要输人的打算。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4c5eca447ac19e768d4f923fa76980d1361110a218b82fe43204e82a86221e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11757fa73df5c8ff7a7a1bac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为「女帝」就必须随时打起精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41354f0f370426418fe002c1e10a1b93da99229473bc50bfe5f60721eeb34a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32ec6bd39bcca8709ddb4231",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们所憧憬的服装……\r\n像这样实际穿上就能体会到呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20c519351786c7ac81650aee965ad17281726cedba991cd45b2ba2ee1798b221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d464101a0739606e3584edf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻柔的触感……\r\n忍不住会一直想摸呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f81578c02a8cb47715bb179c0d383e6ed82361b24fb20e731c36ae04d94fa629",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24e1d995fff119a1471c8f56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很棒喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c33fd630f9762557b4901bc09551a6cb6fcc915bdd4eb1f2271ec5541068fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d734716199d75ba81b6f8d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "展现我「女帝」的跑法！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84fcf4abf5a332b299238caab3c12d44ff2cd8356e839d5de820892aa417cb1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be79cb49b2c2d77ffa94da15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，去转换一下心情吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b51c35b0b1b612b8faf0903e74526cd2bb39b4699ba2e912f66d6bb5ec8a1d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbdf3dff3d50e1844f91bcfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多选用制作精良的服装，\r\n就是挑选服装的诀窍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "351965567679d6e2462df9adb821ffe9da4c81fdf1a26a4f23d0a56979a66dc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce466cc7de210f616f71ef65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服是学园学生的证明，\r\n所以服装仪容一定要端正。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb35ee899f827a1adf3e968f3df5c35baabfe7f12294e8d8b347c8dff9ac753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
